\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1. Since the Son hath made me free,
\par Let me taste my liberty;
\par Thee behold with open face,
\par Triumph in Thy saving grace,
\par Thy great will delight to prove,
\par Glory in Thy perfect love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2. Abba, Father, hear Thy child,
\par Late in Jesus reconciled;
\par Hear, and ll the graces shower,
\par All the joy, and peace, and power,
\par All my Saviour asks above,
\par All the life and heaven of love.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 3\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 3. Heavenly Adam, Life divine,
\par Change my nature into Thine;
\par Move and spread through out my soul,
\par Actuate and fill the whole;
\par Be it I no longer now
\par Living in the flesh, but Thou.
\par 
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 4\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 4. Hloy Ghost, no more delay;
\par Come, and in Thy temple stay;
\par Now Thine inward witness bear,
\par Strong, and permanent, and clear;
\par Spring of life, thyself impart,
\par Rise eternal in my heart.
\par Amen.\f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

